#. module: fmcg_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fmcg_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"For large or Bulk products, the order &amp; payment is done at the shop, but "
"the delivery is sometimes scheduled later."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການສັ່ງຊື້ &amp; ຊຳລະເງິນແມ່ນເຮັດຢູ່ຮ້ານ, ແຕ່ການຈັດສົ່ງບາງຄັ້ງອາ"
"ດຈະກຳນົດເວລາພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. module: fmcg_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fmcg_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"For the Small Products, orders &amp; payments are made at the shop itself, "
"and the customer picks up the products directly."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ການສັ່ງຊື້ &amp; ຊຳລະເງິນແມ່ນເຮັດຢູ່ຮ້ານໂດຍກົງ, ແລະ ລູກຄ້າຈະຮັບສິນຄ້າໄປເລີຍ."

