#. module: fmcg_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fmcg_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If customers opt to disassemble packages within the shop, the packaging "
"feature becomes essential. For instance, when selecting a Monster Energy "
"drink bottles are in packs of 5 and 10 in the shelves:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລູກຄ້າເລືອກທີ່ຈະຈີກແພັກສິນຄ້າພາຍໃນຮ້ານ, ຄຸນສົມບັດການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ຈະມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອເລືອກເຄື່ອງດື່"
